  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Receiving a Korean delegation during the Offshore Energy Exhibition and Conference in Amsterdam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Receiving a Korean delegation during the Offshore Energy Exhibition and Conferene in Amsterdam. They were provided with welcome drinks and bites, hotel stay, tickets to the conference and a government-made tailored programme during the event. The goal was to strengthen relations between the Netherlands and the Republic of Korea (ROK) and exchange knowledge/policy.</narrative>
  </description>
